1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,204
This building sorts more than four

2
00:00:02,204 --> 00:00:04,208
hundred thousand packages an hour.

3
00:00:04,508 --> 00:00:06,812
Five point two million square feet.

4
00:00:07,712 --> 00:00:09,968
Roughly ninety football fields,

5
00:00:10,268 --> 00:00:11,708
under one roof.

6
00:00:12,658 --> 00:00:15,394
Some planes don't even stop on the ramp.

7
00:00:16,294 --> 00:00:17,807
They pull right up to the

8
00:00:17,807 --> 00:00:19,078
building, nose first,

9
00:00:19,378 --> 00:00:21,418
