12
00:00:28,428 --> 00:00:30,300
Nobody opens your box.

13
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:32,448
Nobody even looks at it.

14
00:00:33,598 --> 00:00:35,657
There are more than a hundred and fifty

15
00:00:35,657 --> 00:00:37,822
